    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Skyland Chronicles on Kickstarter!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our crew and help elevate The Skyland Chronicles to new heights! Back our Kickstarter campaign, unlock unique rewards, and shape a world of pirate legends.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622460/extras/6f7c46a1383d33f45a459a86966cb321.avif?t=1755003461\" width=1072 height=395 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It seems that you're here to discover the first third-person, pirate-themed Roguelike.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although you're just an orphan, your role on this ship is far more important than you think \u2013 you're fighting for the lives of those you love. As a pirate from the Old Harlot, you must stop the rebellion. To do so, you'll need to become the most skilled thief and ruthless warrior. You'll learn the story of every crew member to influence their final decision, making each ending unique. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622460/extras/bf15699538a0efe802b372f457b82bc3.poster.avif?t=1755003461\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622460/extras/bf15699538a0efe802b372f457b82bc3.webm?t=1755003461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622460/extras/bf15699538a0efe802b372f457b82bc3.mp4?t=1755003461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>With each run, sea-worthy adventures await you!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the terror of the seas, striking enemies from the shadows or in open combat. Uncover secrets like a pirate king sailing the Grand Line and engage in epic battles in search of a legendary treasure. You'll write your own legend, one that mermaids will sing about across the oceans!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622460/extras/0bfb52a884bc3fa61e11d766d21725fe.poster.avif?t=1755003461\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622460/extras/0bfb52a884bc3fa61e11d766d21725fe.webm?t=1755003461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622460/extras/0bfb52a884bc3fa61e11d766d21725fe.mp4?t=1755003461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Have you ever played a roguelike where your growth is built around the pirate crew?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a living hub, taking care of your crew and their stats determines access to shops and character upgrades. Their mood will decide whether you set off on your next expedition well-prepared, which means this isn\u2019t a game for everyone \u2013 you\u2019ll need to approach not only your resources strategically but also manage your entire crew to gain an edge on each run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622460/extras/35e7d51de2baa06e4cd950741154b585.poster.avif?t=1755003461\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622460/extras/35e7d51de2baa06e4cd950741154b585.webm?t=1755003461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622460/extras/35e7d51de2baa06e4cd950741154b585.mp4?t=1755003461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>High Replay Value on Treacherous Waters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you step aboard, you uncover new secrets. Together with your friend, you work to unravel the mystery of the impending rebellion, with limited time to figure out who in the crew is on your side. Each run presents a new, unknown story full of unexpected twists that change the course of events \u2013 failure comes with consequences you\u2019ll feel in your pocket, because for a pirate, gold is the key to success!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622460/extras/403c639d07a26b843991172c8dc414b8.poster.avif?t=1755003461\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622460/extras/403c639d07a26b843991172c8dc414b8.webm?t=1755003461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622460/extras/403c639d07a26b843991172c8dc414b8.mp4?t=1755003461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Reasons You Don\u2019t Want To Miss It:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first story-driven 3D third-person roguelike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first roguelike with graphics as good as those in story-driven titles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first roguelike with stealth mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first pirate-themed roguelike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replay value with an epic adventure.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622460/extras/0686aae4176e6f7fcc5078875277f55b.poster.avif?t=1755003461\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622460/extras/0686aae4176e6f7fcc5078875277f55b.webm?t=1755003461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622460/extras/0686aae4176e6f7fcc5078875277f55b.mp4?t=1755003461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Skyland Chronicles on Kickstarter!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our crew and help elevate The Skyland Chronicles to new heights! Back our Kickstarter campaign, unlock unique rewards, and shape a world of pirate legends.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622460/extras/6f7c46a1383d33f45a459a86966cb321.avif?t=1755003461\" width=1072 height=395 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It seems that you're here to discover the first third-person, pirate-themed Roguelike.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although you're just an orphan, your role on this ship is far more important than you think \u2013 you're fighting for the lives of those you love. As a pirate from the Old Harlot, you must stop the rebellion. To do so, you'll need to become the most skilled thief and ruthless warrior. You'll learn the story of every crew member to influence their final decision, making each ending unique. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622460/extras/bf15699538a0efe802b372f457b82bc3.poster.avif?t=1755003461\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622460/extras/bf15699538a0efe802b372f457b82bc3.webm?t=1755003461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622460/extras/bf15699538a0efe802b372f457b82bc3.mp4?t=1755003461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>With each run, sea-worthy adventures await you!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the terror of the seas, striking enemies from the shadows or in open combat. Uncover secrets like a pirate king sailing the Grand Line and engage in epic battles in search of a legendary treasure. You'll write your own legend, one that mermaids will sing about across the oceans!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622460/extras/0bfb52a884bc3fa61e11d766d21725fe.poster.avif?t=1755003461\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622460/extras/0bfb52a884bc3fa61e11d766d21725fe.webm?t=1755003461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622460/extras/0bfb52a884bc3fa61e11d766d21725fe.mp4?t=1755003461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Have you ever played a roguelike where your growth is built around the pirate crew?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a living hub, taking care of your crew and their stats determines access to shops and character upgrades. Their mood will decide whether you set off on your next expedition well-prepared, which means this isn\u2019t a game for everyone \u2013 you\u2019ll need to approach not only your resources strategically but also manage your entire crew to gain an edge on each run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622460/extras/35e7d51de2baa06e4cd950741154b585.poster.avif?t=1755003461\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622460/extras/35e7d51de2baa06e4cd950741154b585.webm?t=1755003461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622460/extras/35e7d51de2baa06e4cd950741154b585.mp4?t=1755003461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>High Replay Value on Treacherous Waters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you step aboard, you uncover new secrets. Together with your friend, you work to unravel the mystery of the impending rebellion, with limited time to figure out who in the crew is on your side. Each run presents a new, unknown story full of unexpected twists that change the course of events \u2013 failure comes with consequences you\u2019ll feel in your pocket, because for a pirate, gold is the key to success!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622460/extras/403c639d07a26b843991172c8dc414b8.poster.avif?t=1755003461\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622460/extras/403c639d07a26b843991172c8dc414b8.webm?t=1755003461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622460/extras/403c639d07a26b843991172c8dc414b8.mp4?t=1755003461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Reasons You Don\u2019t Want To Miss It:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first story-driven 3D third-person roguelike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first roguelike with graphics as good as those in story-driven titles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first roguelike with stealth mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first pirate-themed roguelike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replay value with an epic adventure.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622460/extras/0686aae4176e6f7fcc5078875277f55b.poster.avif?t=1755003461\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622460/extras/0686aae4176e6f7fcc5078875277f55b.webm?t=1755003461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622460/extras/0686aae4176e6f7fcc5078875277f55b.mp4?t=1755003461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2>",
    "short_description": "The Skyland Chronicles is a third-person pirate roguelike with soulslike combat. You must quell a mutiny aboard the Old Harlot and uncover Franco\u2019s story - an infant abandoned at sea and rescued by the pirates of Old Europe. His only clue is a crescent-shaped medallion that restores him to life.",
